<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/18th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">American Revolutionary War</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1775">1775</a>–<a href="/years/1783">1783</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/18th-century">18th century</a> · Also known as American War of Independence</p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The American Revolutionary War was fought between <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/britain">Britain</a> and its rebel colonies in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/north-america">North America</a>, which declared independence as the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a> in 1776. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/france">France</a>, <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spain">Spain</a> and the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dutch-republic">Dutch Republic</a> joined against Britain, and German states such as Hesse-<a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/kassel">Kassel</a> and Ansbach hired out soldiers to the British. The <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/treaty-of-paris-1783">Treaty of Paris</a> of 1783 recognised American independence.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/american-revolutionary-war.jpg" alt="American Revolutionary War" width="320" height="211" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: John Trumbull · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Surrender_of_Lord_Cornwallis.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
